---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main>
			<h1>Coobeeyon Development Limited</h1>
			<p><i>Useful software for difficult problems.</i></p>

			<hr />

			<h2>What I do</h2>
			<p>
				Coobeeyon is the consulting practice of <b>Michael Daum</b>, a software
				developer in Toronto. I work directly with clients on hard product and
				engineering problems. When a project needs more people, I bring in seasoned
				specialists I trust.
			</p>
			<p>
				I am especially drawn to rich graphical interfaces, useful artificial
				intelligence, complex data, and software that has to work in the real world.
			</p>

			<h2>Selected client work</h2>
			<h3>Interactive construction planning</h3>
			<p>
				A rich browser-based planning system that turns complex construction drawings
				into structured project data and applies useful AI to difficult planning
				problems.
			</p>
			<h3>Three-dimensional electrical design</h3>
			<p>
				Browser-based tools for electrical design, from model conversion and custom
				section rendering to precision editing of generated conduit routes and visual
				diagnostics.
			</p>

			<h2>Selected experiments &amp; obsessions</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="https://farcaster.xyz/coobeeyon"><b>Stigmergence:</b></a>
					An autonomous agent exploring generative art and the market.
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/coobeeyon/Asteroids"><b>Genetic Asteroids:</b></a>
					Evolution revolution.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Pair-programming tools</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/coobeeyon/litebrite"><b>litebrite:</b></a>
					A small task tracker for work shared with coding agents.
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/coobeeyon/mrmouth"><b>mrmouth:</b></a>
					A supervisor that sends coding agents off to do bounded jobs in containers.
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/coobeeyon/trk"><b>trk:</b></a>
					A small project wiki that keeps useful context close to the code.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<p>
				Read the <a href="/blog">writing</a>, learn more <a href="/about">about
				Coobeeyon</a>, or <a href="mailto:mike.daum@coobeeyon.net">send me a note</a>.
			</p>

			<hr />

			<p>Best viewed in Netscape Navigator 3.0 at 800x600 resolution.</p>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
